COLLISION CHECK (Task 3 pre-check, reported either way as instructed):
/api/push/preferences owns the separate PushPreference table
(masterEnabled/dailyGoalReminder/streakAtRisk/badgeEarned). PUT
/users/me/preferences writes User.uiLanguage/theme + NotificationPreference
(userId/category/channel/enabled) — different table, different shape. No
collision; no reconciliation needed; neither endpoint was modified to
accommodate the other.

